  designNotes: 'Gravity (the user, 2026-10-17: a logistics shutdown): for 2 Days
    nobody moves: every creature on the board is Rooted. Moves, swaps and Maneuvers
    all stop; a Spin or a Shuffle leaves everyone where they are.'
  artDescription: An empty city street at night under a CURFEW 22:00 sign, every
    window lit with a face pressed to the glass, a lone police car's light sweeping
    the road, and one cat sitting in the middle of it, the only one allowed out.
